; error: 10:5: '|>' gives the value before it to the call after it, so a value comes first, as in 'xs |> total()'; a line starting with it goes on with the chain of a line that ends with a value
task double(n: int) -> int
    <- n * 2
fi

task main()
    when true
        show(1)
    fi
    |> double()
fi
